   "job": "Powers the drone: an estimated 2.7 survey flights per charge. Six cells in series give 21.6 V under load; six in parallel give 30 Ah.",
   "why": "648 Wh in 2.72 kg. In a hot-day hover each cell carries 9.3 A, against a 60 A rating. It gives 59 min of loiter with 20 % left, or 2.7 survey flights per charge.",
   "instead": "Samsung 50S ($6.99 a cell, $72 cheaper): voltage sag at our current not measured, so it needs a bench test first. Samsung 50E: 9.8 A rating, too low. A LiPo pack of the same mass would hold about 40 % less energy.",
